WEBVTT

00:00:57.164 --> 00:01:00.486
Sasa,mada yangu ni kuhusu kushukuru.

00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:03.288
Kuna uhusiano gani kati ya

00:01:03.288 --> 00:01:07.295
furaha na kushukuru?

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:10.328
Watu wengi watasema,sawa,hiyo ni rahisi sana.

00:01:10.328 --> 00:01:14.331
Ukiwa na furaha,basi unashukuru.

00:01:14.331 --> 00:01:17.550
Lakini tazama tena.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:22.909
Ni kweli kwamba watu wenye furaha wana shukrani?

00:01:22.909 --> 00:01:26.642
Sote tunafahamu namba kiasi ya watu

00:01:26.642 --> 00:01:30.843
ambao wana kila kitu cha kuwafanya wawe na furaha,